  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Interpret C rotary `\"axis\": [0, 0, -1]` as clockwise about `+Z` (`-1.0`) and `[0, 0, 1]` or unstated as `+Z` (`+1.0`).\n- Add `AxisLimits::c_z_sense`, `AxisLimits::c_program_travel`, `Machine::c_axis`, and `Machine::reversed_c_rotary` in `crates/post/src/machine/direction.rs`.\n- Refuse non-finite, zero, or non-Z C vectors (`d[2]^2 < 0.998 * |d|^2`) by name across `AxisLimits::c_z_sense`, `operation::rotary_gate::stamp_c_about`, `machine::judge::c_letter_problem`, and `assets/posts/fanuc-lathe.cps` (`liveStart`).\n- Flip asymmetric `-Z` C travel `[lo, hi]` to `[-hi, -lo]` in `stamp_c_about`, check `sign * c` in `c_letter_problem`, and negate posted `C` (`liveCSense * Number(p.C)`) in `assets/posts/fanuc-lathe.cps` (`liveMove`).\n- Emit `  C rotary turns clockwise about +Z (-Z axis) - posted C is negated for this machine` under `MACHINE AXES` in `crates/app/src/setup_sheet/sections.rs` (`render_machine_axes`).\n- Subdivide `Move.arc` moves in `crates/cl/src/cl/rotary.rs` (`stamp_c`) via `Move::segments3(tol * 0.5)`, refine chords at `tol * 0.5`, emit `arc: None`, rotate piece poses with `pose_at`, and refuse non-finite arc centers by name.\n- Add end-to-end World tests in `crates/app/tests/c_axis_live_world.rs` and record the design choices in `docs/decisions/33-c-sense-and-arcs.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nPrior slices (`#286` and `#860`) left `-Z` C rotary sense and curved C-turn moves unimplemented. `cl::stamp_c` rejected all arc moves, and the machine gate, lathe post, and setup sheet assumed `+Z` C sign only.\n\n## Tests\n\n### Pinning tests (red before fix)\n- `cl::rotary::tests::an_arc_in_xy_and_a_full_helix_ride_a_c_turn_within_tol` failed on `upstream/main` because `stamp_c` refused arcs.\n- `script_fanuc_lathe::a_minus_z_c_axis_posts_negated_c` and `script_fanuc_lathe::a_non_z_c_axis_refuses_by_name` failed (`15 passed; 2 failed`).\n- `c_axis_live_world::a_minus_z_c_axis_flips_travel_gate_post_and_setup_sheet` and `c_axis_live_world::a_tilted_c_axis_is_refused_by_name_in_machine_check` failed (`1 passed; 2 failed`).\n\n### Passing pins after final edits\n- `camcraft-cl`: `cl::rotary::tests::{an_arc_in_xy_and_a_full_helix_ride_a_c_turn_within_tol, a_leaning_pose_and_an_arc_refuse_by_name}` (`lib` 42, `headless_bin` 3, `origin_approach` 5 passed; 0 failed).\n- `camcraft-post`: `machine::direction::c_sense_tests::c_z_sense_and_program_travel_reflect_axis_sign` (`lib` 59 passed; 0 failed) and `script_fanuc_lathe::{a_minus_z_c_axis_posts_negated_c, a_non_z_c_axis_refuses_by_name}` (`17 passed; 0 failed`).\n- `camcraft-sim`: `c_axis_fixture::an_arc_stamped_turn_convicts_fixed_station_steel_mid_turn` (`9 passed; 0 failed`).\n- `camcraft-app`: `operation::rotary_gate::tests::minus_z_c_rotary_flips_asymmetric_travel_in_gate` (`lib` 341 passed; 0 failed; 1 ignored) and `c_axis_live_world::{an_in_app_world_c_axis_program_passes_gate_posts_and_renders_setup_sheet, a_minus_z_c_axis_flips_travel_gate_post_and_setup_sheet, a_tilted_c_axis_is_refused_by_name_in_machine_check}` (`3 passed; 0 failed`).\n\n### Mutation checks (reverted `upstream/main` code fails, restored code passes)\n- `crates/cl/src/cl/rotary.rs`: `an_arc_in_xy_and_a_full_helix_ride_a_c_turn_within_tol` (red -> green).\n- `assets/posts/fanuc-lathe.cps`: `a_minus_z_c_axis_posts_negated_c` and `a_non_z_c_axis_refuses_by_name` (`2 failed` -> `17 passed; 0 failed`).\n- `crates/app/src/operation/rotary_gate.rs`: `minus_z_c_rotary_flips_asymmetric_travel_in_gate` (red -> green).\n- `crates/app/src/machine/judge.rs`: `a_tilted_c_axis_is_refused_by_name_in_machine_check` and `a_minus_z_c_axis_flips_travel_gate_post_and_setup_sheet` (`2 failed` -> `3 passed; 0 failed`).\n- `crates/app/src/setup_sheet/sections.rs`: `a_minus_z_c_axis_flips_travel_gate_post_and_setup_sheet` (red -> green).\n\n### Gate and clippy\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` fell back to `batch` because `crates/cl/src/cl/rotary.rs` changed.\n- `[01] geometry` (0s), `[02] kernel` (110s, 3 ignored), `[03] cl` (0s), `[04] tools` (0s), `[05] post` (18s), `[06] sim` (261s, 4 ignored), `[07] motion` (899s, 17 ignored), `[08] app` (1588s, 31 ignored), and `[10] clippy -D warnings` (66s across all 8 workspace crates) passed with 0 failures.\n- `[09] ui` exited 101 in 200s: 18 of 19 UI binaries passed with 0 failures (`859+1+3+6+3+3+6+7+11+6+4+31+21+2+3+14+4+1` passed; 7 ignored). `trace_parity` hit `signal: 11 (SIGSEGV)` under parallel `llvmpipe` Vulkan execution after `the_kernel_refuses_its_bad_inputs_by_name` passed.\n- Running the compiled `trace_parity` binary standalone (`--test-threads=6`) passed `5 passed; 0 failed` twice (0.80s and 0.79s). Re-running `xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --only ui` failed on `sccache` WebDAV reachability (`Network unreachable`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-cl -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with 0 warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Batch skips `SLOW_BINARIES` (`motion:finish3d`, `motion:pivot5d`, `motion:flow`, `app:center_cut_multiaxis`), release-tier `#[ignore]`d heavy lanes, and UI pixel snapshots.\n- Real Fanuc control execution and composite feed-law measurement require physical machine verification.\n- Remaining owed items on `#33` stay open: axial/face live-tool `G12.1` polar interpolation, real-control composite feed check, and `live_tool` words in shipped `assets/machines/millturn.mch`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#1209`: touches `crates/app/src/setup_sheet/sections.rs` in `render_wcs`; this PR touches `render_machine_axes` (different function; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- `#468`: held (`conflicts`); touches `assets/posts/fanuc-lathe.cps` in `afterOp`, `onRapid`, `onLinear`, and `meridianArc`; this PR touches `liveCSense`, `endPreamble`, `liveStart`, and `liveMove`.\n- `#1738`: stacked on `#1717`; lists `assets/posts/fanuc-lathe.cps` relative to its base and states it does not change posted G-code.\n\nChangelog: support `-Z` C-axis rotary sense across machine checks, rotary gate, Fanuc lathe post, and setup sheets, and subdivide arcs in `cl::stamp_c`.\nEffort: high\nRefs #33\n",
